\]

\label{bridge:matrix}
Fix a design $(w,\beta)$ and a choice of terminal attachment, including
its arm length when present. For each $j\geq1$ there are a finite
nonnegative integer matrix $T_j$ and nonnegative integer vectors $u_j,w_j$,
independent of $R$, such that
\begin{equation}\label{bridge:count}
 Z_{X_R}(j)=u_j^{\mathsf T}T_j^R w_j\qquad(R\geq1).
\end{equation}
